contains LZ4 support files outside `lib`, which LZ4 licenses under
GPL-2.0-or-later unless stated otherwise; see licenses/LICENSE.LZ4-GPL.

The R source package also carries unused zstd sources from divsufsort and
JoinPaths; see licenses/LICENSE.divsufsort and licenses/LICENSE.JoinPaths.

Release wheels also bundle the transport runtimes:

  curl 8.22.0             curl license     licenses/LICENSE.curl
  OpenSSL 3.x             Apache 2.0       licenses/LICENSE.OpenSSL

Python wheels include the applicable license texts under `dist-info/licenses/`;
native archives use `licenses/`, and the R package uses `inst/licenses/`.
